From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: FoAKTEE <hw609@cantab.ac.uk>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 11:47:53 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 05/16] feat(m1-metric): add the superposed Kerr-Schild binary
 metric SKS

- change: src/bbh_metric.c: per-hole Kerr-Schild term (hypot-form root, f = 2 m r^3/(r^4 + a^2 z^2), covariant l) exactly as BlackLightPlus _ks_term, g = eta + sum_A f_A l^A l^A without regularisers, and the exact Woodbury inverse (2x2 solve)
- change: runtime binary file bbh.in ($RAPTOR_BBH): masses, spins along +z, centres, march control and camera distance, read by set_constants
- change: helpers ks_radius_hole, horizon_radius_hole, horizon_distance = min_A (r_A - r_h,A), normal_frame_energy_u; get_r returns the global coordinate radius for SKS
- change: metric_dd/metric_uu dispatch to the SKS forms; model/blp_analytic/model.c defines the core globals (vacuum model); run/makefile compiles bbh_metric.c
- next: M2a/M2b derivatives, R04 metric comparison
